msgstr "那根杖子看起来很有用！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DORSALFIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DORSALFIN"
