msgstr "哦，好吧，我肯定那儿还有许多！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYFEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYFEATHER"
