msgstr "火龙曾经存储其情感的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONSPIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONSPIT"
