msgstr "现在可以把它带到任何地方了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_BUSH_VINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_BUSH_VINE"
