msgstr "我想我应该把它捡起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_COFFEEBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DUG_COFFEEBUSH"
