msgstr "它工作正常。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.OUT"
