msgstr "它需要更多燃料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.VERYLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.VERYLOW"
