#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_HEXAGON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_HEXAGON"
