msgstr "向你致敬，帽匠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HATMAKER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HATMAKER.SLEEPING"
