msgstr "你是怎么活到现在的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_PROFESSOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_PROFESSOR.SLEEPING"
