msgstr "老年人很渴睡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_QUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_QUEEN"
