msgstr "你好，警官。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ROYALGUARD_2.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ROYALGUARD_2.SLEEPING"
