msgstr "好像可以从这里出去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_HEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_HEAD"
