msgstr "修剪东西时的声音很好听。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_ADJUSTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_ADJUSTABLE"
