msgstr "用来放东西的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_INDUSTRIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_INDUSTRIAL"
