msgstr "真是个完美致命的长鼻！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING"
