msgstr "谢谢你带给我安全感，灯光！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.CITY_LAMP.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.CITY_LAMP.ON"
