msgstr "我很确定那是一盏路灯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.CLAWPALMTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.CLAWPALMTREE"
