msgstr "我不太确定这是怎么工作的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH"
