msgstr "我的烹饪方式...就是把什么都丢进去，然后等着！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL"
