msgstr "在这个附近我有一种不舒服的绝望感觉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN_ROCK"
