msgstr "我敢打赌它会浮在水中。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.CORKBOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.CORKBOAT"
