#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT"
msgid "Maybe it doubles as a blanket."
msgstr "也许把它对折可以当毛毯。"

