msgstr "留着这些东西好像没什么用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC"
