msgstr "我看到你了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
