msgstr "希望你的肚子跟你的眼睛一样大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING"
