msgstr "如果你饿了就眨两下眼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT"
