msgstr "适合旅行携带的食物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SMASHINGPOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SMASHINGPOT"
