msgstr "现在对任何人都没什么用了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.CHOPPED"
