msgstr "那些藤是我的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.GENERIC"
