msgstr "我有冲浪板，要这个干嘛？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_AMPHIBIOUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_AMPHIBIOUS"
