msgstr "抱歉，小蛇兄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_FIRE"
