msgstr "我们不必开战。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON.SLEEPING"
