#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING"
