msgstr "它已经凉透了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED"
