msgstr "看起来相当可悲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT"
