msgstr "这肯定是高级时装。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT"
