msgstr "我-靠！这太特么残忍了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET"
