#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.GENERIC"
