msgstr "那我们该怎么做呢?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_FLOATING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_FLOATING"
msgid "A place to put one's things."
msgstr "一个用来放东西的地方。"

