msgstr "他看起来很警惕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
