msgstr "毫无疑问它是有价值的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL"
