msgstr "飞天野兽的神龛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
