msgstr "我说！那是一座相当华丽的纪念碑！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
