msgstr "哼。一个配不上雕像的人，如果你问我的话。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMSANDWICH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMSANDWICH"
