msgstr "这是火腿三明治。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
