msgstr "蜜蜂产物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.STONE_DOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.STONE_DOOR"
