msgstr "我真希望它能通向一些有趣的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
