msgstr "我说！那次航行发生了一个令人不快的转折。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.ABANDONED"
