msgstr "我说！我想知道，还有幸存者吗?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_BURNT"
