msgstr "遗憾的是里面没有比蜡更坚硬的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_4"
