msgstr "呼哈！我得把它捞出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTELESCOPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTELESCOPE"
