msgstr "一种寻找可以探索的地图的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF"
