msgstr "啊。经典之作。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
