msgstr "我说！这顿饭真难吃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO"
