msgstr "我应该把它们种了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SWIMMINGHORROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SWIMMINGHORROR"
