msgstr "我说！它很难看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_BASIC_BULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_BASIC_BULB"
