msgstr "相当华丽的灯光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_DERBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_DERBY"
