msgstr "我说！一顶高礼帽！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH"
