msgstr "我确实喜欢吃一点太妃糖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
