msgstr "神奇的长着羽毛的怪物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
