msgstr "我突然感觉好多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATOSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATOSOUFFLE"
