msgstr "慰藉灵魂、滋养身体的食物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO"
