#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_BLOOMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_BLOOMER"
