msgstr "让我流口水了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_PENDANT_CHERRIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_PENDANT_CHERRIES"
