msgstr "比起食物还是当作药物更好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT_COOKED"
