msgstr "显然是用来完成某种转动动作的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_POTATO"
