msgstr "真是座不错的雕像。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMSANDWICH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMSANDWICH"
