msgstr "我感觉它仿佛在嘲笑我的处境。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_3"
