msgstr "我该如何捞起它？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPERTELESCOPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPERTELESCOPE"
