msgstr "虽然不是三件套，但足够体面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATOSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATOSOUFFLE"
