msgstr "它让我感觉好好笑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INFUSED_IRON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INFUSED_IRON"
