msgstr "我们应该把这放在地上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_WOODPANELS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_WOODPANELS"
