msgstr "我打赌我们可以用这做各种各样的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.IRONWIND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.IRONWIND"
