msgstr "它既不是果冻也不是鱼，而且它已经失去了生命。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_PLANTED"
