msgstr "大海充满了这样奇奇怪怪的垃圾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JELLYJERKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JELLYJERKY"
