msgstr "什么东西都要尝试一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JELLYOPOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JELLYOPOP"
