#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_TRUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_TRUNK"
