#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE"
msgid "We can't cut that down with an axe."
msgstr "我们用斧子砍不倒它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP
