#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIMPETROCK.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIMPETROCK.PICKED"
