#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAGNIFYING_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAGNIFYING_GLASS"
