msgstr "曼德拉草。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.PICKED"
