msgstr "蝎子。但我不确信是哪一个亚种。” "

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCORPION.SLEEPING"
