msgstr "鸥科鸟类中的食腐动物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEASACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEASACK"
