msgstr "我一直都想成为一个以水为基的园艺师。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.EMBERS"
