msgstr "一种攀缘植物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL"
