msgstr "腹足类动物的罕见变种。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH"
