msgstr "有了这个，我就能对那些蜘蛛进行心灵控制了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE"
