msgstr "水让植物很开心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.WITHERED"
