msgstr "我觉得凶光没有变强。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING"
