msgstr "凶光来了并且正在变强。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK"
