msgstr "啊哦。火灭了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANMACHETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANMACHETE"
