msgstr "真锋利！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANSPEARGUN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANSPEARGUN"
