msgstr "把你的财宝给沃尔夫冈！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSKING"
