msgstr "用来保管俺的战利品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_METAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_METAL"
msgid "A sturdy port fer me booty."
msgstr "保管俺战利品的结实港湾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_MIDCENTURY
